<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Digital Proof of Delivery (POD)</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            The definitive record of commercial fulfillment, capturing authoritative multi-factor 
            evidence of handover at the exact moment of delivery.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Multi-Factor Handover Evidence</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate disputes and paper reconciliation with a digital-first Proof of Delivery 
            process. The driver captures the recipient's signature directly on their mobile 
            terminal, which is then augmented with precision GPS coordinates and a 
            high-resolution timestamp of the event. Photo capture allows for the 
            documentation of goods condition at the point of handover, providing your 
            organization with ironclad evidence of successful fulfillment.
        </p>
        <p>
            Completed POD records are instantly transmitted to the central system, making 
            them available to dispatch, sales, and accounts teams before the driver 
            has even returned to the vehicle.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Exception Management & Reason Codes</h2>
        <p>
            Not every delivery is successful. Our POD module includes robust exception handling 
            for partial deliveries, refused goods, or failed arrival attempts. Drivers 
            select from standardized reason codes and capture supporting photographic 
            evidence for issues like "Not Home," "Damaged Packaging," or "Incorrect 
            Address." This Granular data allows for immediate operational follow-up 
            and more accurate reporting of delivery success rates.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated alerts are triggered for management review whenever a high-value 
            delivery is refused or a major discrepancy is captured at the point 
            of handover.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Integrated Commercial Closure</h2>
        <p>
            The POD is the trigger for the next phase of the commercial lifecycle. Native 
            integration with the Pindah ERP ensures that once a POD is captured, the 
            corresponding sales order is updated, potentially triggering the generation 
            of the final tax invoice or adjusting inventory levels. Digital PODs are 
            immediately visible in the Client Portal, providing your customers with 
            instant confirmation and peace of mind.
        </p>
        <p>
            This integrated closure significantly reduces the "Order-to-Cash" cycle time by 
            eliminating the delays associated with physical paperwork processing and 
            manual data entry.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

